/-!
# A020654

Lexicographically earliest infinite increasing sequence of nonnegative numbers containing no 5-term arithmetic progression.

The 67 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A020654

/-- Known terms of `A020654`, starting at index `1`. -/
def data : List retType :=
  [0, 1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, 8, 10, 11,
    12, 13, 15, 16, 17, 18, 25, 26, 27, 28,
